g Earnings?","src":"The Motley Fool","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNY0JQLW9ldzZ3N0w3WVJyVmFDdy1WT1V5QnNSZHBvTkU4SDFLeS1FZU1hYkg0UjQwNlZUM2Z6LXNIS1VPVDZ2M0paT0lFZy12X0p1ZmdSc2dXbnJXLURuWFlaMFBuckdvSElkcndROEhVUjR1dzNsTk9sYjg5Tldjc2VReHMteHFVbVRxVl80V3dmS0YzUUlUdkxOVlpaQlhfSmFVRWM4UXhnd0VuZTdQMGQxeWVFRXJnNTJ4Y19IbEstWjg2U3RkaUxwdmY?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"為什麼 VICI Properties 的股票在強勁獲利後沒有反彈？"},{"title":"VICI Properties Q3 AFFO, Revenue Rise; Lifts 2026 Guidance","src":"Moomoo","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPYmJjSXJ4UGFCdWtxSnl3am1FY3pNdm9IcjUxX2Vlc3JnaXluNEk4QTRBVS0tYWlZVW4tT2tCbGMydW9fZlk5TkNYRXliT295cGltb1JqTUEzeFVEc184aXZZOWlmdWJrYW9ObFVnRndfdEdCaHdkT0lWZXR0NzdqQzRjcHdIQUw1T1lWLVk5TTlYbmVtMnNRU2VZeWxHdnBJN2c?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"VICI Properties 第三季 AFFO，營收成長； 2026 年電梯指南"},{"title":"Vici Properties revenues improve, profit narrows","src":"CDC Gaming","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9uVzEzcnF4SUdKeHY3bzdaRXNUY20xa3JEdGpBc3czb2R0d3dPZjZQZVFGX2JSSVlkTXVLU19YbEdheFNVU0Z0a2pYOC1qWHA1Z0M5aTFVZjFjbjY0T0p2T19yVUczN2NoblVPVW12S2h2aWt0dTFOTjFR?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Vici Properties 營收改善，獲利收窄"},{"title":"[VICI Properties Q3 2026 Earnings Call] VICI Raises 2026 AFFO Guidance to $2.47–$2.48 Per Share, But CEO Ed Pitoniak Admits 'Disappointment' With Stock as Caesars Lease Clouds Outlook","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5ZTEpUVkNEbHBUU3BzOW01a18yTlBTU1RpOGY0cGE2UkdITzg0UGRPUkdrVlNseW4xX0FPOS1SWjk0eUNfbFIzdzZVYm5udTV2LVJ4VFZreHl1eTI2d3c?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"[VICI Properties 2026 年第三季度收益電話會議] VICI 將 2026 年 AFFO 指導上調至每股 2.47-2.48 美元，但首席執行官 Ed Pitoniak 承認對股票“失望”，因為凱撒租賃前景黯淡"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":14},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":4},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1705696/000170569626000034/vici-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a Maryland corporation that is primarily engaged in the business of owning and acquiring gaming, hospitality, wellness, entertainment and leisure destinations, subject to long-term triple net leases. As of December 31, 2025, we own 93 experiential assets across a geographically diverse portfolio consisting of 54 gaming properties and 39 other experiential properties across the United States and Canada, including Caesars Palace Las Vegas, MGM Grand and the Venetian Resort Las Vegas (the \"Venetian Resort\"), three of the most iconic entertainment facilities on the Las Vegas Strip. Our gaming and entertainment facilities are leased to leading brands that seek to drive consumer loyalty and value with guests through superior services, experiences, products and continuous innovation. Across approximately 127 million square feet, our well-maintained properties","zh":"我們是一家馬裡蘭州公司，主要從事擁有和收購博彩、酒店、健康、娛樂和休閒目的地的業務，並遵守長期三重淨租賃。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們在不同地域的投資組合中擁有 93 項體驗式資產，其中包括美國和加拿大的 54 家博彩物業和 39 家其他體驗式物業，包括拉斯維加斯凱撒宮酒店、米高梅大酒店和拉斯維加斯威尼斯人度假村（“威尼斯人度假村”），這是拉斯維加斯大道上最具標誌性的三個設施。我們的遊戲和娛樂設施出租給領先品牌，這些品牌尋求透過卓越的服務、體驗、產品和持續創新來提高消費者的忠誠度和價值。我們維護良好的物業佔地約 1.27 億平方英尺"},{"en":"are currently located across urban, destination and drive-to markets in twenty-six states and Canada, contain approximately 60,300 hotel rooms and feature over 500 restaurants, bars, nightclubs and sportsbooks. As of December 31, 2025, our properties are 100% leased with a weighted average lease term, including extension options, of approximately 39.6 years.","zh":"目前遍佈 26 個州和加拿大的城市、目的地和駕車前往市場，擁有約 60,300 間飯店客房，並設有 500 多家餐廳、酒吧、夜總會和體育博彩。截至2025年12月31日，我們的物業已100%出租，加權平均租賃期限（包括延期選擇權）約為39.6年。"},{"en":"We also have a growing array of real estate and financing partnerships with leading developers and operators in other experiential sectors, including Cabot, Cain, Canyon Ranch, Chelsea Piers, Great Wolf Resorts, Homefield, Kalahari Resorts and Lucky Strike Entertainment. This portfolio includes certain real estate debt investments which were originated for strategic purposes, including (i) the potential to convert our investment into the ownership of the underlying real estate, (ii) the opportunity to develop relationships with owners and operators that may lead to other investments in experiential asset classes that fit within our investment policies and objectives, and (iii) the ability to make investments in experiential asset classes outside of gaming with a goal of increasing our investment activity in these asset classes over time. In addition, we own approximately 33 acres of unde","zh":"我們還與其他體驗領域的領先開發商和營運商建立了越來越多的房地產和融資合作夥伴關係，包括 Cabot、Cain、Canyon Ranch、Chelsea Piers、Great Wolf Resorts、Homefield、Kalahari Resorts 和 Lucky Strike Entertainment。該投資組合包括出於戰略目的而發起的某些房地產債務投資，包括（i）將我們的投資轉換為基礎房地產所有權的潛力，（ii）與所有者和運營商建立關係的機會，這可能會導致對符合我們的投資政策和目標的體驗式資產類別進行其他投資，以及（iii）對遊戲之外的體驗式資產類別進行投資的能力，隨著這些時間的資產類別中增加我們在這些活動之外的體驗式資產類別中的資產。此外，我們還擁有約 33 英畝的土地"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We compete for real property investments with other REITs, gaming companies, investment companies, private equity firms, hedge funds, sovereign funds, lenders and other private investors. In addition, we are ultimately dependent on the ability of our tenant operators to maintain competitiveness with other gaming operators in their respective markets and fulfill their rent obligations. Although the nature and degree varies by market, the operators of our properties compete on a local, regional, national and international basis for customers. The gaming industry is characterized by a high degree of competition among a large number of participants, including traditional brick-and-mortar casinos, video lottery, sweepstakes and poker machines not located in casinos, Native American gaming, internet gaming, sports betting and other forms of gaming and betting in the United States, including em","zh":"我們與其他房地產投資信託基金、博彩公司、投資公司、私募股權公司、對沖基金、主權基金、貸方和其他私人投資者競爭房地產投資。此外，我們最終依賴我們的租戶營運商維持與各自市場中其他博彩營運商的競爭力並履行租金義務的能力。儘管性質和程度因市場而異，但我們的物業業者在本地、區域、國家和國際層面上爭取客戶。博彩業的特點是參與者眾多，競爭激烈，包括傳統的實體賭場、視訊彩票、不在賭場內的抽獎和撲克機、美洲原住民博彩、互聯網博彩、體育博彩以及美國其他形式的博彩和博彩，包括新興市場和博彩業。"},{"en":"As a landlord, we compete in the real estate market with numerous developers, owners and acquirors of properties. Some of our competitors may be significantly larger, have greater financial resources and lower costs of capital than we have, have greater economies of scale and have greater name recognition than we do. Increased competition makes it more challenging to identify and successfully capitalize on acquisition opportunities that meet our investment objectives. Our ability to compete is also impacted by global, national and local economic trends, availability of investment alternatives, availability and cost of capital, construction and renovation costs, existing laws and regulations, new legislation, and demographic and cultural trends.","zh":"作為房東，我們在房地產市場上與許多開發商、業主和房地產收購者競爭。我們的一些競爭對手可能比我們規模大得多，擁有更多的財務資源和更低的資本成本，擁有更大的規模經濟和更高的知名度。競爭的加劇使得識別並成功利用滿足我們投資目標的收購機會變得更具挑戰性。我們的競爭能力也受到全球、國家和地方經濟趨勢、投資選擇的可用性、資本的可用性和成本、建築和裝修成本、現有法律法規、新立法以及人口和文化趨勢的影響。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["WPC","STAG","PLD","O","ADC"]}}